$DATUM Synthesis of N-(6-chlorobenzo[d]thiazol-2-yl)hydrazine To the warm
hydrazine hydrate solution of compound 2 in alcohol, conc. NaOH was added
and refluxed for 6 h. Reaction mixture was poured into crushed ice and
solid obtained was filtered off and dried. The solid collected out was
recrystallized from suitable solvent. Yield 82%. m.p. 241-243 °C;
Rf-value 0.71; IR (KBr) ν cm-1: 657 (C-S-C), 817 (C-Cl), 1588 (C=N), 1660
(C=O), 3300 (NH); 1H NMR (DMSO-d6) δ (ppm): 7.28 (s, 1H, NHNH2),
7.70-7.74 (m, J= 12 Hz, 3H, Ar-H), 9.12 (s, 1H, NHC=O).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
