3-Cyclopropyl-1-[4-[4-(1-cyclopropylsulfonylcyclopropyl)-6-[(3S)-3-methylmorpholin-4-yl]pyrimidin-2-yl]phenyl]urea
(35). Yield 74%. 1H NMR (DMSO-d 6) δ 0.33-0.47 (m, 2H), 0.63 (td, J =
