$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of quinolyl urea 21. To a solution of disphosgene (ClCO2CCl3)
(32 μL, 0.265 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (1.3 mL) at 0°C was added dropwise a
solution of amine 18 (261 mg, 0.443 mmol) and proton sponge (187 mg,
0.875 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (1.3 mL). The reaction mixture was warmed to rt,
stirred for 15 min, and concentrated in vacuo. The residue was
redissolved in CH2Cl2, washed with 1M HCl (4X’s) and 1M NaOH (1X), dried
over MgSO4, filtered, and concentrated in vacuo. Crude isocyanate 19,
which was used directly in the next step without purification. Crude
isocyanate was dissolved in anhydrous toluene (1.3 mL), and
8-aminoquinoline 20 (319 mg, 2.22 mmol) was added at rt. The reaction
mixture was further stirred at rt for 4 h and then directly purified on
silica gel (0-5% gradient of MeOH in CH2Cl2). 268 mg (0.353 mmol, 80%
yield for 2 steps) of 21 as a beige solid. M.p. = 108-110 °C; [α]D 22 =
-4.2° (c = 1.0, CHCl3); 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3, rt) δ 9.27 (s, 1H), 8.66
(dd, J = 4.4 Hz, 1.6 Hz, 1H), 8.48 (d, J = 7.6 Hz, 1.2 Hz, 1H), 8.05 (dd,
J = 8.4 Hz, 1.2 Hz, 1H), 7.44 (t, J = 8.0 Hz, 1H), 7.32 (ovrlp m, 3H),
7.24 (dd, J = 8.6 Hz, 2.4 Hz, 1H), 7.19 (d, J = 8.4 Hz, 2H), 6.92 (d, J =
8.4 Hz, 1H), 6.81 (d, J = 8.8 Hz, 2H), 6.64 (br s, 1H), 5.09 (br s, 1H),
4.40 (ovrlp d, J = 11.6 Hz, 1H), 4.36 (ovrlp d, J = 11.6 Hz, 1H), 4.28
(ovrlp m, 4H), 4.19 (br m, 1H), 4.05 (br ovrlp m, 2H), 3.86-3.72 (ovrlp m
2H), 3.73 (ovrlp s, 3H), 3.46 (br ovrlp m, 2H), 2.98 (br ovrlp m, 2H),
2.67 (s, 3H), 2.25 (br m, 1H), 1.97 (br m, 1H), 1.25 (d, J = 6.0 Hz, 3H),
1.10 (br s, 3H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, DMSO-d6, 115 °C) δ 166.3, 158.4,
158.3, 154.3, 147.3, 146.8, 143.0, 137.4, 135.9, 135.7, 130.1, 129.9,
128.3, 127.4, 126.4, 121.0, 119.9, 118.6, 117.0, 115.4, 114.0, 113.3,
99.2 (weak), 81.1 71.8, 71.4, 63.9, 63.6, 54.6, 52.0, 50.4, 41.7, 36.1,
34.6, 14.47, 14.45; IR (thin film) νmax 3314, 2927, 1655, 1585, 1529,
1489, 1339, 1248, 1205, 1154, 1064, 742, 567 cm-1; HRMS (ESI+) m/z
calculated for C39H46N5O9S (M+H): 760.3011, found 760.3020.
