5.81-5.55 (m, 1H), 5.36-5.13 (m, 2H), 5.11-4.88 (m, 2H), 4.19 (br.s, 1H),
3.95 (s, 3H), 3.75 (br.s, 1H), 3.63-3.41 (m, 2H), 3.26 (br.s, 2H),
3.15-2.97 (m, 1H), 2.83-2.65 (m, 3H), 2.56 (s, 1H), 2.30 (br.s, 2H),
1.70-1.43 (m, 4H), 0.94-0.79 (m, 1H). 13C NMR (101 MHz, CDCl3) δ 158.35,
158.02, 147.57, 144.73, 140.85, 138.29, 132.36, 131.65, 131.01, 129.27,
128.91, 128.46, 126.39, 121.88, 114.95, 102.07, 71.87, 65.65, 64.32,
