$DATUM 1-((R)-7-Fluoro-2,2-dimethylchroman-4-yl)-3-((R)-7-hydroxy-
5,6,7,8-tetrahydronaphthalen-1-yl)urea (35). A mixture of DSC (0.774 g,
3.02 mmol) and acetonitrile (10 mL) was stirred at ambient temperature,
and a solution of (R)-8-amino-1,2,3,4-tetrahydronaphthalen-2-ol3 (0.470
g, 2.88 mmol) in acetonitrile (10 mL) and pyridine (0.244 mL, 3.02 mmol)
were added. After 20 min, (R)-7-fluoro-2,2- dimethylchroman-4-aminium
(R)-2-hydroxy-2-phenylacetate29 (1.0 g, 2.88 mmol) was added, followed by
acetonitrile (10 mL) and i-Pr2NEt (1.508 mL, 8.64 mmol). After 5 h at
ambient temperature, the reaction mixture was diluted with EtOAc (300
mL), washed with 1N NaOH (200 mL), water (200 mL), and brine (200 mL),
and the organic phase was dried (Na2SO4) and concentrated. Purification
by silica gel chromatography (gradient elution, 0-10% MeOH in EtOAc) gave
(R)-hydroxytetralin urea 35. Yield (1.023 g, 2.66 mmol, 92%). 1H NMR (300
MHz, DMSO-d6) δ 7.70 (d, J = 7.9 Hz, 1H), 7.59 (s, 1H), 7.34- 7.25 (m,
1H), 7.01 (t, J = 7.8 Hz, 1H), 6.94 (d, J = 8.4 Hz, 1H), 6.80- 6.69 (m,
2H), 6.59 (dd, J = 10.6, 2.6 Hz, 1H), 4.98-4.88 (m, 1H), 4.86 (d, J = 4.1
Hz, 1H), 4.00-3.88 (m, 1H), 2.90-2.63 (m, 3H), 2.34 (dd, J = 16.6, 7.7
Hz, 1H), 2.16 (dd, J = 13.3, 6.1 Hz, 1H), 1.94-1.81 (m, 1H), 1.70 (dd, J
= 13.2, 10.9 Hz, 1H), 1.65-1.51 (m, 1H), 1.40 (s, 3H), 1.29 (s, 3H). MS
(ESI) m/z 385 (M + H)+; [α]23 D +20.2° (c 1.0, CH3OH).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Discovery of
(R)-1-(7-Chloro-2,2-bis(fluoromethyl)chroman-4-yl)-3-(3-methylisoquinolin-5-yl)urea
(A-1165442): A Temperature-Neutral Transient Receptor Potential
Vanilloid-1 (TRPV1) Antagonist with Analgesic Efficacy
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
