(232 mg, 1.25 mmol) and DMAP (5 mg, 0.033 mmol) were added. The reaction
was sealed and microwaved at 100 °C for 15 min. The solid was filtered
off, concentrated, and purified by flash chromatography, eluted with
EtOAc/ hexanes.
