$DATUM 2-Chloro-N-[(6-ethenylsulfonylbenzothiazol-2-yl)carbamoyl]benzamide. To a
solution of 2-chlorobenzamide (0.16 g, 1.0 mmol) in THF (10 mL) was added
oxalyl chloride (95 mL, 1.1 mmol) and the reaction mixture was heated at
120°C in a microwave for 5 min. To this was added
6-ethenylsulfonylbenzothiazol-2-amine (0.24 g, 1.0 mmol) [WO2002/057370]
and the suspension was heated at 120°C in a microwave for 5 min. The
organic phase was decanted and evaporated to give the title compound
(0.30 g, 71%). 1H NMR (300 MHz, DMSO-d6) 6.21 (1H, d), 6.36 (1H, d), 7.16
(1H, dd), 7.50-7.52 (1H, m), 7.58-7.61 (2H, m), 7.66-7.68 (1H, m),
7.87-7.90 (1H, m), 7.97 (1H, d), 8.66 (1H, d), 11.81 (2H, s); m/z MH+ =
422.
