$DATUM tert-Butyl
4-(2-(3-(2-chloro-5-(1H-pyrazol-1-yl)benzoyl)ureido)benzothiazol-6-ylsulfonyl)piperidine-1-carboxylate
To a suspension of 2-chloro-5-(1H-pyrazol-1-yl)benzamide (9.12 g, 41.1
mmol) in DCE (300 mL) was added oxalyl chloride (5.38 mL, 61.7 mmol). The
suspension was heated at 65°C for 90 min. Dioxane (300 mL) was added and
the reaction mixture was concentrated in vacuo. A solution of 59 (15.5 g,
39.1 mmol) in DMF (50 mL) was added to the concentrated mixture at 80°C
and heating continued for 15 min. The reaction mixture was concentrated
in vacuo, diluted with Et2O (500 mL) and stirred overnight. The
precipitate was filtered to give the title compound as a solid (15.0 g,
59%). 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d6) 1.33-1.41 (10H, m), 1.87 (2H, d), 2.54
(1H, t), 2.68-2.68 (1H, m), 2.73 (1H, d), 3.51 (1H, t), 3.98-4.02 (2H,
m), 6.62-6.63 (1H, m), 7.74 (1H, d), 7.83 (1H, d), 7.86-7.89 (1H, m),
8.00 (1H, d), 8.05-8.07 (1H, m), 8.21 (1H, s), 8.62 (1H, d), 8.63 (1H,
s), 11.91 (2H, s); m/z MH+ = 645.
