4-Chloro-1-(2-{[(5-chloro-[1,3]thiazolo[5,4-b]pyridin-2-yl)carbamoyl]amino}phenyl)-7-methoxy-3-methyl-2,3-dihydro-1H-indole-3-carboxylate
(8a-e). To a solution of 7a (450 mg, 1.25 mmol) and 4-nitrophenyl
chloroformate (277 mg, 1.37 mmol) in DCM (3 mL) was added K2CO3(345 mg,
2.49 mmol). The reaction was stirred at room temperature (rt) overnight.
The solid was filtered off, and 5-chlorothiazolo[5,4-b]pyridin-2-amine
(232 mg, 1.25 mmol) and DMAP (5 mg, 0.033 mmol) were added. The reaction
was sealed and microwaved at 100 °C for 15 min. The solid was filtered
off, concentrated, and purified by flash chromatography, eluted with
EtOAc/ hexanes.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
