$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Separately, 145 mg of Fmoc-NHNH2 HCl was suspended in 10 mL of THF. Under
ice cooling, 89 mg of CDI and 87 µL of DIPEA were added to the suspension
followed by stirring at room temperature for 1 h. Under ice cooling, a
solution of 224 mg of H-Leu-OBut HCl in 5 mL of DMF was added to the
mixture. The mixture was stirred for 18 h at room temperature. After the
solvent was distilled off, the residue was dissolved in AcOEt, and the
solution was washed with 1N HCl aq. solution, satd NaHCO3 aq. solution,
and then by satd NaCl aq. solution. After drying over Na2SO4 , the
solvent was concentrated. Purification by flash column chromatography.
230 mg of Fmoc-azaGly-Leu-OBut (yield 99%).
