7.30-7.17 (m, 10H), 4.66 (t, J= 5.4 Hz, NH), 3.68-3.60 (m, 2H), 2.67 (t,
J= 6.6 Hz, 2H), 2.17-1.93 (m, 1H), 1.70-1.56 (m, 4H), 1.41-1.26 (m, 4H),
1.17-1.06 (m, 2H). LCMS (ESI) m/z: 532 [M + H]+.
