Hz, 1H), 4.40 (d, J = 6.0 Hz, 2H), 2.88-2.79 (m, 4H), 1.55-1.47 (m, 4H),
1.35-1.30 (m, 2H). LCMS (method LCMS1, ESI): RT = 1.01 min, m/z = 375.2
[M + H]+.
