(27). The title compound was prepared from 76 and
3-(trifluoromethyl)aniline using method B, purified by column
chromatography (eluent gradient CH2Cl2:MeOH = 70:1), and recrystallized
from EtOAc and petroleum ether.
1-(4-(1H-Pyrazolo[3,4-d]pyrimidin-4-yloxy)phenyl)-3-(3-(trifluoromethyl)phenyl)urea
(27), Yield: 84%. HPLC purity: 98% 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ 14.14 (s,
