2H),7.32 (m, 1H), 7.18 (d, J=7.2 Hz, 1H), 6.92 (d, J=6.4 Hz, 2H), 6.82
(d, J=6.4 Hz, 1H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ 163.2, 156.7, 154.9,
