1-(4-(1H-pyrazolo[3,4-d]pyrimidin-4-yloxy)phenyl)-3-(2-chloro-4-(trifluoromethyl)phenyl)urea
(32) The title compound was prepared from 76 and
2-chloro-4-(trifluoromethyl)aniline using Method B, purified by column
chromatography (eluent gradient CH2Cl2:MeOH 75:1), and recrystallized
from EtOAc and petroleum ether to provide 32. 32. Yield: 78%, 98% HPLC
purity 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ 14.16 (s, 1H), 9.76 (s, 1H), 8.68 (s,
