(100 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ 163.1, 156.7, 154.9, 151.8, 146.8, 139.7, 136.9,
131.8, 126.2, 124.8, 122.4, 121.4, 120.2, 119.6, 101.3.LCMS m/z: 449.8 [M
+ H] +.
