column chromatography on silica gel to give 10a. Ethyl
2-(N-((4-Bromo-6-methoxypyrimidin-2-yl)carbamoyl)-sulfamoyl)benzoate
(10d). Yield: 0.85 g (64%), starting from 2.89 mmol of 2 and 2.89 mmol of
8. White solid. Mp: 167-169 °C. 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ 11.996 (s,
