(t, J = 5.6 Hz, 2H, CH2Br). 13C NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ 169.766,
165.894, 155.926, 151.211, 148.110, 136.191, 134.163, 131.477, 131.409,
131.130, 129.595, 105.176, 65.309, 54.984, 30.107. HRMS (ESI, m/z):
C15H15Br2N4O6S (M + H+) calcd 536.9074, found 536.9066.
